The "app" directory differs from the "cmd" directory in that it is not built by default. These are proof-of-concept apps that are built on top of other more fundamental ports available in lib and cmd. Some might have their sources in sys/src/external (especially those with unreliable download links (sourceforge) or where local source changes are needed). Others might have an integrated download/install scheme in the mkfile, making this a kind of "ports" directory.
